Enchanter","level":1,"materialPolicy":"nativeCountDeterminesLevelDebitDivisorTimesLevelNoContainers","maxLevel":5,"offeredMaximum":"5","offeredMinimum":"3","pickupPolicy":"creativeBypassXpElseSignedLevelDebit","version":"2.9.28"},"properties":{},"source":{"handler":"crazypants.enderio.nei.EnchanterRecipeHandler","key":"native-enchanter-level-1","owner":"EnderIO"}},"strings":[{"id":"text_33646d5fefb3121a9625e96c63c03f02c44024b434eadf76652b06cbda90b763","locale":"en_US","text":"The first matching material recipe wins before its count is checked. Divide the actual signed stored count by the registration-time items-per-level divisor, then cap at the enchantment maximum. Normal book-slot insertion admits writable books, while runtime only requires presence and pickup clears the whole book slot. Materials debit divisor times actual level, retaining any remainder without containers. XP cost uses native signed-int accumulation; creative mode bypasses its check and payment. This is a conditional output for the stated level interval, not every larger inventory."}]}